s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/294ef16f8484d700c2cba8089c95237b.avif?t=1748462073\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with one of your friends (each turn a different friend). The one with the most points at the end of all turns wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/7ad3e2dc5df97dde42a101bea55e6bb7.poster.avif?t=1748462073\" width=400 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/7ad3e2dc5df97dde42a101bea55e6bb7.webm?t=1748462073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/7ad3e2dc5df97dde42a101bea55e6bb7.mp4?t=1748462073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/9f9c59bc0721df4015462be1e47e73d6.avif?t=1748462073\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download, Play, and provide feedback! The demo already contains the game modes above, with spices for infinite replay-ability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure if it's for you here are the requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a controller for each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cozy couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-3 friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have a couch? Try playing with Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/a82ad58e333e09352802eb46dc932122.avif?t=1748462073\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game caught your attention, help the game development by a\u00a0<strong>wishlist</strong>.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301400/extras/295a00e3deb082f580f8a43281448b8c.avif?t=1748462073\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have any <strong>feedback</strong>, <strong>opinion</strong>, or <strong>ask</strong>? Reach out to me at the game's discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
